      "message": "test(post): cycle_hop reads the recorded stream with LF line endings\n\nA Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true turned \" AT 1\\n\" into\n\" AT 1\\r\\n\", so the seat-path pin failed its anchor assert (review of\nPR #1019). Normalise CRLF the way the recorded runner does.\n\nRefs #994\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
