      "message": "test(post): conformance synth stream states its hop; synth goldens lock the hop seat\n\nThe conformance synth stream was the one fixture with back-to-back cycle\nrecords and no RetractPlane, which the hop seat now refuses by name. It\nnow states PARAM ClearancePlane 10 and RetractPlane 5 like a generated\nstream. The six cycle-post synth goldens (fanuc, haas, mazak, sinumerik,\ntormach, doosan-dnm) each climb to the hop (work Z0) before the XY move\nto each hole and drop to R (Z-3) after it, instead of traversing at R.\nSinumerik's N numbers shift. Heidenhain and Carvera are unchanged.\n\nFixes #1028\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "f37f51a356dc04c45247d0f3a2a3b3a0ed5a25c6",
